"⟪k:18⟫Hahh, ⟪k:19⟫hah... ⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫haahh !"

#: scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1e18bbc0a2fb0df7b4e152dad7fed060820bcbb244578ef4c4d254fd1ee7a51
#. default-sha256: 3015078b4fcc9b4bc5b4504b969926400b467c49195e738002ce4e1a1f210acf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In a fevered frenzy, Mell fled from the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫Even in early summer, the night was "
"cold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fébrile, éperdu, Mell s’enfuit loin du manoir. ⟪k:1⟫En ce début d’été, la nuit était encore "
"froide."

#: scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dc4fc41d11c702959372ee77f739253f753aba31be27f6966d8e461630d19dc
#. default-sha256: e30ed3b15dac684aa5a7abec1d4c2629d7145138cc566c5d0f181476462a48ec
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And to make matters worse, raindrops pelted him from head to toe."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et comme pour aggraver les choses, il tombait des seaux d’eau, le trempant jusqu’aux os."

#: scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7aa1169f8e788cf19b1c153ce59fb465425c68fbbe62ff9457ed84e3ba5ba6d
#. default-sha256: ff055cf3376a90aa6483fe18ede0ef3977c5b6bfa3713cb5679c433a30626cbb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that caused him little discomfort, for a far greater maelstrom of pain rampaged within "
"his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais cela ne le dérangeait pas, car une plus grande tempête encore ravageait son cœur "
"souffrant."

#: scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b763f6a0ca60699ca2dcc18a1d8de8194cc90ba5f64d36382a3b3f4217a112fe
#. default-sha256: afba4344a9cb0e8b45943cf6bcad378337b49d303494aa558c69685f07ea667c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At night, the town took on a different appearance. ⟪k:1⟫Not simply for lack of illumination, "
"but the people active within it as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De nuit, la ville changeait d’apparence. ⟪k:1⟫Pas simplement parce qu’il n’y avait plus de "
"lumière, mais aussi à cause des gens qui écumaient les rues."

#: scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffb143a08de5c5e738900f90d211ff95978cc376e9433918a5eca9332ad12e50
#. default-sha256: 06d62317714882db9546063cd61024fbe428405660eb90b80c8f482b4e6b932c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not a suitable place for a young aristocratic man to go wandering unattended."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce n’était pas un lieu convenable pour se promener seul, surtout quand on était un jeune "
"noble."

#: scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5310f7ad62248cbaccfda5f3e4c98ce4d7a27f115a92ec519df9f20770f0e2e
#. default-sha256: 57bfbc9c7aada05e1ebf2dfd9b1688f399224a90545a77bbac0cb330aa6844a8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness is not only the abode of devils, but of beggars, thieves, criminals, and all "
"manner of things undesirable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’obscurité abritait des créatures démoniaques mais aussi des mendiants, des voleurs, des "
"criminels et toutes sortes d’individus peu recommandables."

#: scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135
