#: scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bd7db64eeb89015940d82e2949bade0a0fc1a37e510da85596bb9613db6a7cb
#. default-sha256: 37bb08a2c7a6893a00213e1fb8ce1f9fb2c1e31d4fa5b18a85d1af06faa981ab
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But as you might expect, the door was locked, and the priest showed no sign of responding to "
"his calls. ⟪k:1⟫The sound of the pouring rain drowned out everything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais comme vous vous en doutez, la porte était fermée à clé, et le prêtre ne manifestait "
"aucun signe de vie. ⟪k:1⟫Le bruit de la pluie battante couvrait tout le reste."

#: scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487
